sentences.text:
In the result, the following:
ORDER (i) MFA No.200145/2018 filed by the claimants is dismissed;
 (ii) MFA No.200410/2018 filed by the  Insurance company is allowed;
 (iii) The Judgment and award dated 15.12.2017 in MVC No.804/2016 passed by Motor Accidents Claims Tribunal No.3,
Vijaypur, is hereby - 11 - NC: 2026:KHC-K:963 HC-KAR set aside; the claim petition is accordingly dismissed;
(iv) The amount in deposit be refunded to the appellant-Insurance company in MFA No.200410/2018.

